{
  "info": {
    "name": "Rumboo · satrack-service",
    "_postman_id": "6b1d6c0e-3a63-4d8e-9f4b-2f5c1a7e0b11",
    "description": "Consulta los vehículos y las posiciones de una cuenta Satrack a través del microservicio.\n\nUso:\n1. Importa esta colección y el environment `satrack-local.postman_environment.json`.\n2. En el environment completa `apiKey` (SATRACK_SERVICE_API_KEY del .env), `satrackUsername` y `satrackPassword`.\n3. Ejecuta la carpeta \"Flujo completo\" con el Collection Runner, o las peticiones en orden. Las peticiones de resultado se repiten solas en el Runner hasta que el job termina; a mano, vuelve a enviarlas hasta ver `status: done`.\n4. Abre la pestaña **Visualize** de las peticiones de resultado para ver la tabla de vehículos y posiciones.\n\nEl servicio responde 202 y procesa en segundo plano; con Satrack real el primer job tarda 30–90 s (login con Chrome). Los siguientes reutilizan la sesión.\n\nLos scripts aceptan accountJson generado desde variables o un objeto account escrito en el body. El error de configuración identifica las variables que faltan; el job_id se toma de la respuesta real para consultar el resultado.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "apikey",
    "apikey": [
      {
        "key": "key",
        "value": "X-Api-Key",
        "type": "string"
      },
      {
        "key": "value",
        "value": "{{apiKey}}",
        "type": "string"
      },
      {
        "key": "in",
        "value": "header",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "vehiclesJobId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "positionsJobId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "platesJson",
      "value": "[\"ABC123\"]"
    },
    {
      "key": "pollAttempts",
      "value": "0"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Flujo completo",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1. Health",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/health",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "health"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Proveedor activo (`satrack` o `simulator`), jobs en curso y sesiones de Chrome abiertas."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Servicio arriba', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "console.log('Proveedor:', body.provider);",
                  "if (body.provider !== 'satrack') console.warn('El servicio corre con el simulador: los datos NO son de Satrack. Arráncalo con PROVIDER=satrack.');"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "2. Vehículos · crear job",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/jobs",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "jobs"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"job_id\": \"{{vehiclesJobId}}\",\n  \"type\": \"vehicles\",\n  \"account\": {{accountJson}},\n  \"plates\": []\n}"
            },
            "description": "Pide todas las placas que ve la cuenta. Responde 202 de inmediato; el resultado se consulta en la petición 3."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const rawBody = pm.request.body.raw || '';",
                  "const isSet = value => value !== undefined && value !== null && String(value).trim() !== '';",
                  "const missing = [];",
                  "const headerKey = pm.variables.replaceIn(pm.request.headers.get('X-Api-Key') || '');",
                  "if (!isSet(pm.variables.get('apiKey')) && (!isSet(headerKey) || headerKey.includes('{{'))) missing.push('apiKey');",
                  "const usesAccountJson = rawBody.includes('{{accountJson}}');",
                  "if (usesAccountJson) {",
                  "  for (const name of ['satrackUsername', 'satrackPassword']) {",
                  "    if (!isSet(pm.variables.get(name))) missing.push(name);",
                  "  }",
                  "}",
                  "for (const match of rawBody.matchAll(/{{\\s*([^{}]+?)\\s*}}/g)) {",
                  "  const name = match[1];",
                  "  if (name.startsWith('$') || name === 'vehiclesJobId' || (name === 'accountJson' && usesAccountJson)) continue;",
                  "  if (!isSet(pm.variables.get(name))) missing.push(name);",
                  "}",
                  "if (missing.length) {",
                  "  pm.execution.setNextRequest(null);",
                  "  throw new Error('Faltan variables: ' + [...new Set(missing)].join(', ') + '. Selecciona el environment local configurado o completa sus valores locales.');",
                  "}",
                  "if (usesAccountJson) {",
                  "  pm.variables.set('accountJson', JSON.stringify({id: pm.variables.get('accountId') || 'satrack-local', username: pm.variables.get('satrackUsername'), password: pm.variables.get('satrackPassword')}));",
                  "}",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('vehiclesJobId', pm.variables.replaceIn('{{$guid}}'));",
                  "pm.variables.set('vehiclesJobId', pm.collectionVariables.get('vehiclesJobId'));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('pollAttempts', '0');"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Job aceptado (202)', () => pm.response.to.have.status(202));",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 202) {",
                  "  const jobId = pm.response.json().job_id;",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('vehiclesJobId', jobId);",
                  "  pm.variables.set('vehiclesJobId', jobId);",
                  "} else {",
                  "  pm.execution.setNextRequest(null);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "3. Vehículos · resultado",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/jobs/{{vehiclesJobId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "jobs",
                "{{vehiclesJobId}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Consulta el mismo job hasta ver status: done. queued/running con result: null significa que aún está en proceso. Send hace una sola consulta: repítela cada 3 segundos o ejecuta Flujo completo con el Collection Runner. Al terminar, result.vehicles[].address contiene la dirección y cada objeto incluye coordenadas, velocidad, estado y reporte disponibles. Guarda las placas en platesJson para la siguiente consulta."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Job encontrado', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "if (pm.response.code !== 200) { pm.execution.setNextRequest(null); return; }",
                  "const job = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (job.status !== 'done') {",
                  "  pm.visualizer.set(`<h3>Consulta en proceso · {{status}}</h3><p>Job: {{job_id}}</p><p>El resultado todavía no está disponible. Con Send, vuelve a enviar este mismo GET cada 3 segundos hasta ver status: done. El Collection Runner repite la consulta automáticamente.</p><p>Al terminar, la dirección estará en result.vehicles[].address.</p>`, job);",
                  "  const attempts = Number(pm.collectionVariables.get('pollAttempts')) + 1;",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('pollAttempts', String(attempts));",
                  "  console.log(`Job ${job.status}; reintento ${attempts}`);",
                  "  if (attempts < 60) { setTimeout(() => {}, 3000); pm.execution.setNextRequest(pm.info.requestName); }",
                  "  else { pm.test('El job terminó dentro del plazo', () => pm.expect.fail('Se agotaron 60 consultas')); pm.execution.setNextRequest(null); }",
                  "  return;",
                  "}",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('pollAttempts', '0');",
                  "const result = job.result;",
                  "if (result.status === 'failed') { pm.test('Proveedor disponible', () => pm.expect.fail(result.errors.map(e => e.code).join(', '))); pm.execution.setNextRequest(null); return; }",
                  "pm.test('Consulta a Satrack exitosa', () => pm.expect(result.status, JSON.stringify(result.errors)).to.not.equal('failed'));",
                  "const plates = result.vehicles.map(v => v.plate).filter(p => /^[A-Z]{3}\\d{3}$/.test(p));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('platesJson', JSON.stringify(plates));",
                  "if (!plates.length) pm.execution.setNextRequest(null);",
                  "console.log(`${result.vehicles.length} vehículos; ${plates.length} con placa reconocible`);",
                  "pm.visualizer.set(`",
                  "<style>body{font-family:sans-serif}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%}td,th{border:1px solid #ddd;padding:6px;text-align:left}th{background:#1a4f8b;color:#fff}.err{color:#d8432f}</style>",
                  "<h3>{{count}} vehículos · estado {{status}}</h3>",
                  "{{#each errors}}<p class='err'>{{code}}: {{message}}</p>{{/each}}",
                  "<table><tr><th>Placa</th><th>Alias en Satrack</th><th>Dirección</th><th>Latitud</th><th>Longitud</th><th>km/h</th><th>Estado</th><th>Reporte UTC</th><th>Último reporte (texto Satrack)</th><th>Id dispositivo</th></tr>",
                  "{{#each vehicles}}<tr><td>{{plate}}</td><td>{{name}}</td><td>{{address}}</td><td>{{lat}}</td><td>{{lng}}</td><td>{{speed_kmh}}</td><td>{{status}}</td><td>{{reported_at}}</td><td>{{reported_at_raw}}</td><td>{{device_id}}</td></tr>{{/each}}</table>`,",
                  "  { count: result.vehicles.length, status: result.status, vehicles: result.vehicles, errors: result.errors });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "4. Posiciones · crear job",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/jobs",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "jobs"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"job_id\": \"{{positionsJobId}}\",\n  \"type\": \"positions\",\n  \"account\": {{accountJson}},\n  \"plates\": {{platesJson}}\n}"
            },
            "description": "Última posición de las placas de `platesJson` (la llena la petición 3; puedes editarla a mano, p. ej. `[\"ABC123\",\"XYZ789\"]`)."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const rawBody = pm.request.body.raw || '';",
                  "const isSet = value => value !== undefined && value !== null && String(value).trim() !== '';",
                  "const missing = [];",
                  "const headerKey = pm.variables.replaceIn(pm.request.headers.get('X-Api-Key') || '');",
                  "if (!isSet(pm.variables.get('apiKey')) && (!isSet(headerKey) || headerKey.includes('{{'))) missing.push('apiKey');",
                  "const usesAccountJson = rawBody.includes('{{accountJson}}');",
                  "if (usesAccountJson) {",
                  "  for (const name of ['satrackUsername', 'satrackPassword']) {",
                  "    if (!isSet(pm.variables.get(name))) missing.push(name);",
                  "  }",
                  "}",
                  "for (const match of rawBody.matchAll(/{{\\s*([^{}]+?)\\s*}}/g)) {",
                  "  const name = match[1];",
                  "  if (name.startsWith('$') || name === 'positionsJobId' || (name === 'accountJson' && usesAccountJson)) continue;",
                  "  if (!isSet(pm.variables.get(name))) missing.push(name);",
                  "}",
                  "if (missing.length) {",
                  "  pm.execution.setNextRequest(null);",
                  "  throw new Error('Faltan variables: ' + [...new Set(missing)].join(', ') + '. Selecciona el environment local configurado o completa sus valores locales.');",
                  "}",
                  "if (usesAccountJson) {",
                  "  pm.variables.set('accountJson', JSON.stringify({id: pm.variables.get('accountId') || 'satrack-local', username: pm.variables.get('satrackUsername'), password: pm.variables.get('satrackPassword')}));",
                  "}",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('positionsJobId', pm.variables.replaceIn('{{$guid}}'));",
                  "pm.variables.set('positionsJobId', pm.collectionVariables.get('positionsJobId'));",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('pollAttempts', '0');"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Job aceptado (202)', () => pm.response.to.have.status(202));",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 202) {",
                  "  const jobId = pm.response.json().job_id;",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('positionsJobId', jobId);",
                  "  pm.variables.set('positionsJobId', jobId);",
                  "} else {",
                  "  pm.execution.setNextRequest(null);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "5. Posiciones · resultado",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/jobs/{{positionsJobId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "jobs",
                "{{positionsJobId}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Consulta el mismo job hasta ver status: done. queued/running con result: null significa que aún está en proceso. Send hace una sola consulta: repítela cada 3 segundos o usa el Collection Runner. Al terminar, result.positions[].address contiene la dirección; cada objeto incluye posición, velocidad, estado y hora del último reporte. VEHICLE_NOT_FOUND si la placa no está en la cuenta; POSITION_UNAVAILABLE si Satrack no expone coordenadas."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Job encontrado', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "if (pm.response.code !== 200) { pm.execution.setNextRequest(null); return; }",
                  "const job = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (job.status !== 'done') {",
                  "  pm.visualizer.set(`<h3>Consulta en proceso · {{status}}</h3><p>Job: {{job_id}}</p><p>El resultado todavía no está disponible. Con Send, vuelve a enviar este mismo GET cada 3 segundos hasta ver status: done. El Collection Runner repite la consulta automáticamente.</p><p>Al terminar, la dirección estará en result.positions[].address.</p>`, job);",
                  "  const attempts = Number(pm.collectionVariables.get('pollAttempts')) + 1;",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('pollAttempts', String(attempts));",
                  "  console.log(`Job ${job.status}; reintento ${attempts}`);",
                  "  if (attempts < 60) { setTimeout(() => {}, 3000); pm.execution.setNextRequest(pm.info.requestName); }",
                  "  else { pm.test('El job terminó dentro del plazo', () => pm.expect.fail('Se agotaron 60 consultas')); pm.execution.setNextRequest(null); }",
                  "  return;",
                  "}",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('pollAttempts', '0');",
                  "const result = job.result;",
                  "if (result.status === 'failed') { pm.test('Proveedor disponible', () => pm.expect.fail(result.errors.map(e => e.code).join(', '))); pm.execution.setNextRequest(null); return; }",
                  "pm.test('Consulta a Satrack exitosa', () => pm.expect(result.status, JSON.stringify(result.errors)).to.not.equal('failed'));",
                  "const rows = result.positions.map(p => ({ ...p, map: p.lat != null ? `https://www.google.com/maps?q=${p.lat},${p.lng}` : null }));",
                  "pm.visualizer.set(`",
                  "<style>body{font-family:sans-serif}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%}td,th{border:1px solid #ddd;padding:6px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top}th{background:#1a4f8b;color:#fff}.err{color:#d8432f}</style>",
                  "<h3>{{count}} posiciones · estado {{status}}</h3>",
                  "{{#each errors}}<p class='err'>{{plate}} {{code}}: {{message}}</p>{{/each}}",
                  "<table><tr><th>Placa</th><th>Alias</th><th>Estado</th><th>Dirección</th><th>km/h</th><th>Lat, Lng</th><th>Último reporte (UTC)</th><th>Texto original</th></tr>",
                  "{{#each rows}}<tr><td>{{plate}}</td><td>{{name}}</td><td>{{status}}</td><td>{{address}}</td><td>{{speed_kmh}}</td>",
                  "<td>{{#if map}}<a href='{{map}}' target='_blank'>{{lat}}, {{lng}}</a>{{else}}sin coordenadas{{/if}}</td>",
                  "<td>{{reported_at}}</td><td>{{reported_at_raw}}</td></tr>{{/each}}</table>`,",
                  "  { count: rows.length, status: result.status, rows, errors: result.errors });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Casos de error",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "API key inválida (401)",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "apikey",
              "apikey": [
                {
                  "key": "key",
                  "value": "X-Api-Key",
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "key": "value",
                  "value": "clave-incorrecta",
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "key": "in",
                  "value": "header",
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/jobs",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "jobs"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{}"
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('401', () => pm.response.to.have.status(401));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Payload inválido (422, sin eco de la contraseña)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/jobs",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "jobs"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"job_id\": \"{{$guid}}\",\n  \"type\": \"positions\",\n  \"account\": { \"id\": \"prueba\", \"username\": \"prueba\", \"password\": \"no-se-devuelve\" },\n  \"plates\": []\n}"
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('422', () => pm.response.to.have.status(422));",
                  "pm.test('La respuesta no incluye la contraseña', () => pm.expect(pm.response.text()).to.not.include('no-se-devuelve'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
